        "title": "Case Study: Boeing 787 Dreamliner",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The 787 represents the most ambitious structural composites program in commercial\naviation history — and the one with the most publicly documented lessons learned.\nIt went over budget, over schedule, and encountered post-service issues (battery\nfires, delamination) that illustrate the full lifecycle complexity of composites."
